{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next addition to the <strong>Beach Invasion</strong> game series, this time bringing the players to defend against the greatest amphibious operation during the <strong>First World War</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.poster.avif?t=1764851734\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.webm?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.mp4?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this FPS/Tower defense game,  players defend the beach fortifications against invading forces who will attack your position with troops, armored cars, biplanes, planes and more! Use a variety of iconic and authentic WWI weapons stretching from machine guns to coastal artillery, and field cannons to anti-air guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.poster.avif?t=1764851734\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.webm?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.mp4?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Beach Invasion 1915-Gallipoli</strong> brings  modern FPS realism to arcade style on-rail shooter game mechanics. The players can choose to play two scenarios; in the first as a Turkish soldier\u00a0  defending the beaches of Gallipoli, in the second one as a British soldier defending the Suez Canal. Moreover they can play together with friends in online <strong>CO-OP gamemode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.poster.avif?t=1764851734\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.webm?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.mp4?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During these immense amphibious  operations,  player's task is to destroy as many of the invading forces as possible in continous waves, utilizing a variety of weapons and bonuses from the supply drops, such as\u00a0Poison Gas, Armor Piercing, Explosive and Incendiary ammunition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to previous games in the franchise, players can now determine the <strong>precise location</strong> of where they want the <strong>artillery fire</strong> to hit. <strong>New enemies</strong> include infantry who will  charge with their <strong>bayonets</strong>, <strong>armored cars</strong>, <strong>motorcycles</strong>,  <strong>bi-planes</strong> and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Last Gentleman's War ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/da2f1cf0e6266f7ce2678c278cc6149fa2d3dbb4.jpg"},{"name":"Heroes who shed their blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/116f9ea863190b4be0e3bd068c86b93d6cfca2dc.jpg"},{"name":"Liyakat Medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/f851e2ea9885f6952117bbcf8716306e1362a648.jpg"},{"name":"Imtiyaz Medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/5b6088ae428421e907b27b1677be1a802bca1926.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/6c918abf47f3af0949d9910e605bc656c6e318d5.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Order of Osmaniyye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/6e47469f6adc3288200ade10be02a219f92475d5.jpg"},{"name":"Seyit Onbasi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/eca07ebb70105c8a44598ed475c985f85a35b03c.jpg"},{"name":"Dardanelles Impassable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/da3e5a6f238e4042080e81b38acf4c1eb04207bc.jpg"},{"name":"They shall not grow old","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/2e8271ffbb93c2830b6d5ef7d4bd9680d30c3a09.jpg"},{"name":"Shell shock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3556670/9c636a00459eefc1d9aa161095be1104da1f2b04.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556670?t=1764851734","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/08c1a993676a823d146928860b3bcd48c3b4e78a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764851734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/7270fd4a1479a0a50a668d78f5e87b6222261668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764851734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/7270fd4a1479a0a50a668d78f5e87b6222261668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764851734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and mild-gore when shooting soldiers"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next addition to the <strong>Beach Invasion</strong> game series, this time bringing the players to defend against the greatest amphibious operation during the <strong>First World War</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.poster.avif?t=1764851734\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.webm?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.mp4?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this FPS/Tower defense game,  players defend the beach fortifications against invading forces who will attack your position with troops, armored cars, biplanes, planes and more! Use a variety of iconic and authentic WWI weapons stretching from machine guns to coastal artillery, and field cannons to anti-air guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.poster.avif?t=1764851734\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.webm?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.mp4?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Beach Invasion 1915-Gallipoli</strong> brings  modern FPS realism to arcade style on-rail shooter game mechanics. The players can choose to play two scenarios; in the first as a Turkish soldier\u00a0  defending the beaches of Gallipoli, in the second one as a British soldier defending the Suez Canal. Moreover they can play together with friends in online <strong>CO-OP gamemode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.poster.avif?t=1764851734\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.webm?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.mp4?t=1764851734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During these immense amphibious  operations,  player's task is to destroy as many of the invading forces as possible in continous waves, utilizing a variety of weapons and bonuses from the supply drops, such as\u00a0Poison Gas, Armor Piercing, Explosive and Incendiary ammunition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to previous games in the franchise, players can now determine the <strong>precise location</strong> of where they want the <strong>artillery fire</strong> to hit. <strong>New enemies</strong> include infantry who will  charge with their <strong>bayonets</strong>, <strong>armored cars</strong>, <strong>motorcycles</strong>,  <strong>bi-planes</strong> and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["AIx2 Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/9a9ce1ab75beda432bdc2434a8fcc86b63c685d7/header.jpg?t=1764851734","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556670/1413375630/c5da6d11b8a51ed81c539f6f3b220a83cc820e7f/1763064641/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763655159","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556670/1413375630/c5da6d11b8a51ed81c539f6f3b220a83cc820e7f/1763064641/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763655159","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556670/1413375630/c5da6d11b8a51ed81c539f6f3b220a83cc820e7f/1763064641/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763655159","id":257230961,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257230961/ea54c70f717bf4df226cdf6d53532fcff49ffb3c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763655159"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556670/1296036065/bd60b2593a71d7d1fab0f06b986411b98aa28eef/1750840203/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749647437","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556670/1296036065/bd60b2593a71d7d1fab0f06b986411b98aa28eef/1750840203/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749647437","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3556670/1296036065/bd60b2593a71d7d1fab0f06b986411b9